<title>USA: USDA ups Turkey GSM-103 credit line by $20 mln.</title>
<headline>USDA ups Turkey GSM-103 credit line by $20 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Monday said it increased by $20 million the allocation of credit guarantees for sales of U.S. agricultural commodities to Turkey under the GSM-103 program.</p>
<p>USDA said the action boosts Turkey's allocation for fiscal year 1997 to a total of $30 million.</p>
</text>
